# cart

## kategoriden ürün filtreleme ve sepete ekleme
* User clicks "sign-in-link" on "toolshop" page.
*User enters "login.standardUser" into "email" on "toolshop" page.
*User enters "login.password" into "password" on "toolshop" page.
*User clicks "log-in-button" on "toolshop" page.
* User should see "my-account" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "categories-dropdown" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "power-tools-cat" on "toolshop" page.
* User should see "page-title" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "forge-brand-filter" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "sort" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "Name (Z - A)" on "toolshop" page.
* User waits for "2" seconds
* User clicks "product-sheet-sander" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "add-to-cart" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "toast-msg" on "toolshop" page.
* User clicks "cart-link" on "toolshop" page.
* User should see "cart-title" on "toolshop" page.
* User waits for "1" seconds
